window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Life's hard for a muffin lord.</p> <p>Between running a super successful business and falling deeper in love with his men, all the while fretting over a possible war between two kingdoms, Evan has a lot on his plate. With the coming of spring, a festival is held in the kingdom, and Evan is asked to join the celebration. A nice distraction from everything else going on.</p> <p>Coffee, cupcakes, and muffins make the world go round, after all.</p> <p>However, Evan has a secret... one that could destroy all he holds dear. He and his men are happier than any of them ever believed possible. Can that love withstand the battles to come when the truth of his past is revealed?</p> <p><i>Book 4 in the Sent to a Fantasy World series and </i><b><i>must </i></b><i>be listened to in order.</i></p>"; 
